                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                      call mix (left: float                                                     
                      right: float -- float)                                                    
                      Calls a function, consuming its                                           
                      parameters and pushing its                                                
                      return values.                                                            
                      before []                                                                 
                      after: [+float]                                                           
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
                                                                                                
